 "description": "Keith Nester is a Catholic Speaker, Author, and Former Protestant Pastor with over 20 years of experience in Christian Ministry. \n\nIn 2017, after a 20-year journey of prayer and discernment, Keith made the life-changing decision to convert to the Catholic faith. Now, through Down to Earth Ministry, he helps others discover the truth, beauty, and richness of Catholicism.\n\nOn this channel, you’ll find powerful Catholic Conversion Stories, Teachings on Scripture, and Practical Guidance for living the faith in today’s world.\n\nUnpacking the Mass – A weekly Catholic Bible study and reflection on the upcoming Sunday readings.\n\nCatholic Feedback – Real conversations about Catholic apologetics, faith, and life with guests from across the Church.\n\nSubscribe and grow with us as we pray, learn, and live the Catholic faith together.\n\n#Catholic #Rosary #CatholicConvert #CatholicFaith #catholicism #PrayTheRosary #KeithNester  #ConversionStory #DownToEarthMinistry #catholicspeaker #catholicism \n",
